msgid "reCAPTCHA v3 score threshold"
msgstr "reCAPTCHA-v3-Schwellenwert"

#: includes/admin/settings.php:596
msgid ""
"Scores below this value are treated as bots (0.0 = all pass, 1.0 = all "
"blocked). Default: 0.5. Only applies to reCAPTCHA v3."
msgstr ""
"Werte unter diesem Schwellenwert werden als Bot behandelt (0.0 = alle durch,"
" 1.0 = alle blockiert). Standard: 0.5. Gilt nur für reCAPTCHA v3."

